&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there! &lt;br&gt;We’re &lt;a href=&quot;https://feverup.com/&quot;&gt;Fever&lt;/a&gt;, the world’s leading tech platform for culture and live entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission? To democratize access to culture and entertainment. With our proprietary cutting-edge technology and data-driven approach, we’re revolutionizing the way people engage with live entertainment. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every month, our platform inspires over 300 million people in +55 countries (and counting) to discover unforgettable experiences while also empowering event creators with our data and technology, helping them scale, innovate, and enhance their events to reach new audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our results? We’ve teamed up with major industry leaders like Netflix, F.C. Barcelona, and Primavera Sound, presented international award-winning experiences, and are backed by several leading global investors! Impressive, right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we are looking for bar-raisers with a hands-on mindset who are eager to help shape the future of entertainment!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to be part of the experience?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meet the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;At Fever, our Social Media Team makes sure our &lt;strong&gt;brand shines online&lt;/strong&gt; and every project has a strong, authentic presence. We connect and collaborate with users, creators, and influencers around the world to spark conversations and amplify experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;From &lt;strong&gt;digital strategy and content creation&lt;/strong&gt; to &lt;strong&gt;community management, influencer campaigns, and social media monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;, we shape how millions engage with Fever every day. We also provide insights, research, and fresh ideas that fuel new concepts across the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Join us if you want to build communities, create shareable stories, and turn social media into unforgettable experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As an Influencer Marketing Specialist, you will be the driving force behind our creator partnerships, leveraging your deep understanding of social trends to scale our brand&#39;s presence across regions. Operating in a fast-paced startup environment, you will combine a data-driven mindset with exceptional relationship-building skills to manage high-impact influencer campaigns from inception to monetization. Based in Melbourne, your bilingual expertise will bridge cultural gaps, allowing you to seamlessly collaborate across territories and turn strategic creator relationships into measurable business growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and execute influencer marketing strategies and creative campaigns globally at a scale. Drive the development of innovative projects for positive brand growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Set explicit campaign goals, continually assess against benchmarks, and enhance performance by implementing strategies informed by data-driven insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Leverage data insights to pinpoint impactful influencers, refine campaigns through metric analysis, and ensure efficient resource allocation guided by data-driven decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Optimize influencer relationships through streamlined communication, efficient agreement tracking, and global influencer scouting and negotiation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure accurate communication of brand values and philosophy through interactions with influencers globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fluent proficiency in oral and written English and Japanese.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Minimum of 3+ years of experience in influencer marketing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Degree in Marketing, Communications, or related discipline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of initiating, managing, and monetizing relationships with influencers and agencies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong performance and data-driven mindset and business goal-oriented approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Stay abreast of social media trends and technology to identify and build relationships with best-fit influencers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong project management skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent interpersonal and relationship-building skills for effective collaboration across territories.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to adapt to the fast-paced environment of a digital startup.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Detail-oriented, critical thinker, and problem-solver.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Based in or willing to relocate to Melbourne.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You Will Love It Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attractive compensation package with room to grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40% discount on all Fever events and experiences + free Candlelight voucher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superannuation: We invest in your future. Fever contributes 12% of your gross salary to your Super, ensuring your long-term savings grow alongside your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health insurance with GU Health paid by Fever up to 2750 AUD for the annual premium.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClassPass membership for gym and wellness access: paid by Fever up to 39 credits per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language learning support: English and Spanish lessons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup: home office friendly with a central (Sydney; Melbourne) office location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dynamic international team: a young, talented group creating a great work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering joining Fever. We cannot wait to learn more about you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more about us: &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-US/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-UKI/208389-goldman-sachs-asset-management-leads-227m-investment-in-live-entertainment-tech-startup-fever&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Fever&#39;s Blog&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.eu/2023/02/02/fever-raises-110-million-in-new-round-at-1-8-billion-valuation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech.Eu&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;TechCrunch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fever is committed to creating an inclusive and diverse workspace where everyone&#39;s background and ideas count. Our main goal is to find the best possible talent regardless of place of birth, racial or ethnic origin, gender, gender identity, religion, opinion, sexual orientation, disability, pregnancy, marital status, age or caring responsibilities. We encourage everyone to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require any kind of accommodation during the selection process please contact our Talent team so we can help you by providing a welcoming and seamless journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to know more about how Fever processes your personal data, click here&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cIzPP7QJGht5LAGKkRGQP8fxh-Z4Mfph2JhGSvhd8zM/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.y7rpsj7nzave&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Fever - Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

