&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there! &lt;br&gt;We’re &lt;a href=&quot;https://feverup.com/&quot;&gt;Fever&lt;/a&gt;, the world’s leading tech platform for culture and live entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission? To democratize access to culture and entertainment. With our proprietary cutting-edge technology and data-driven approach, we’re revolutionizing the way people engage with live entertainment. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every month, our platform inspires over 300 million people in +55 countries (and counting) to discover unforgettable experiences while also empowering event creators with our data and technology, helping them scale, innovate, and enhance their events to reach new audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our results? We’ve teamed up with major industry leaders like Netflix, F.C. Barcelona, and Primavera Sound, presented international award-winning experiences, and are backed by several leading global investors! Impressive, right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we are looking for bar-raisers with a hands-on mindset who are eager to help shape the future of entertainment!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to be part of the experience?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Madrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;96&quot; data-end=&quot;235&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;117&quot; data-end=&quot;141&quot;&gt;Head of Data Science&lt;/strong&gt; to lead and scale a world-class team, driving high-impact business optimization across Fever.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;237&quot; data-end=&quot;540&quot;&gt;In this role, you will act as a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;269&quot; data-end=&quot;306&quot;&gt;strategic partner to the business&lt;/strong&gt;, translating ambitious goals into a clear, structured, and actionable Data Science roadmap. You will play a key role in shaping how data and advanced analytics are leveraged to improve decision-making and unlock growth opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;542&quot; data-end=&quot;733&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;547&quot; data-end=&quot;557&quot;&gt;leader&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be responsible for building, mentoring, and developing a high-performing Data Science team, fostering a culture of excellence, ownership, and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;735&quot; data-end=&quot;968&quot;&gt;At the same time, you will operate as a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;775&quot; data-end=&quot;800&quot;&gt;hands-on practitioner&lt;/strong&gt;, maintaining strong technical depth. You will review model designs, challenge assumptions, and ensure the highest standards of scientific rigor across all initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;970&quot; data-end=&quot;1096&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;This is a unique opportunity to combine &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1010&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;strategy, leadership, and technical expertise&lt;/strong&gt; to drive meaningful impact at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of Data Scientists that work in several different capacities to improve the overall decision making capabilities at the company to drive business optimisation and connect people to the best and most relevant experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale up the team into a world-class Data Science team owning the full hiring funnel from job definition to offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refine the culture and team dynamics to nurture and grow a cutting-edge Data Science team providing clear mentorship and career growth plans while instilling a culture of intellectual rigour and fast iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as internal evangelist for a data-driven culture, influencing product, commercial, and operations teams to embed advanced Data Science and AI solutions into key business workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help drive the adoption of AI within the Data Science team and the wider organisation augmenting the team’s capability and throughput while retaining scientific excellence and rigour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive projects end-to-end in partnership with cross-functional teams with our stakeholders in business, product, and engineering to devise data-driven solutions to optimise Fever’s business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and deployment of models driving the highest impact within Fever’s business in areas such as marketing optimisation, dynamic pricing, investment decision support, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the experimentation framework (A/B testing, causal inference, incrementality measurement) used to evaluate experiments’ effectiveness at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute towards advancing the Data Science discipline within Fever helping improve standards for analysis, model documentation, monitoring, and deprecation; operationalise data science at production grade.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s or Ph.D. degree in Mathematics, Statistics, Computer Science, Engineering, Economics, or another quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 10 years of work experience in applied analytics, including a minimum of 4 years of experience managing analytics teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading high-performing analytics teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling up analytics teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an entrepreneurial spirit, get stuff done and thrive in a fast paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven experience driving impact through the development, experimentation and deployment of models and data-driven analytics solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong understanding of statistical analysis and modeling including regression, econometric models, time series analysis and forecasting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent communication skills and are proficient in business English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus linked to performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40% discount on all Fever events and experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance and flexible compensation options via Cobee&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English classes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gympass membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary advance via Payflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering joining Fever. We cannot wait to learn more about you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more about us: &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-US/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-UKI/208389-goldman-sachs-asset-management-leads-227m-investment-in-live-entertainment-tech-startup-fever&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Fever&#39;s Blog&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.eu/2023/02/02/fever-raises-110-million-in-new-round-at-1-8-billion-valuation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech.Eu&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;TechCrunch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fever is committed to creating an inclusive and diverse workspace where everyone&#39;s background and ideas count. Our main goal is to find the best possible talent regardless of place of birth, racial or ethnic origin, gender, gender identity, religion, opinion, sexual orientation, disability, pregnancy, marital status, age or caring responsibilities. We encourage everyone to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require any kind of accommodation during the selection process please contact our Talent team so we can help you by providing a welcoming and seamless journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to know more about how Fever processes your personal data, click here&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cIzPP7QJGht5LAGKkRGQP8fxh-Z4Mfph2JhGSvhd8zM/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.y7rpsj7nzave&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Fever - Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

