&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We celebrate&amp;nbsp;strong performance&amp;nbsp;with financial rewards, peer-to-peer recognition, and growth opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

sequoia-aurora-innovation:greenhouse:848.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;Aurora’s mission is to deliver the benefits of self-driving technology safely, quickly, and broadly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;https://aurora.tech/aurora-driver&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://aurora.tech/aurora-driver&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;The Aurora Driver&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;will create a new era in mobility and logistics, one that will bring a safer, more efficient, and more accessible future to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;At Aurora, you will tackle massively complex problems alongside other passionate, intelligent individuals, growing as an expert while expanding your knowledge. For the latest news from Aurora, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://aurora.tech/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;aurora.tech&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;or follow us on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/auroradriver&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aurora hires talented people with diverse backgrounds who are ready to help build a transportation ecosystem that will make our roads safer, get crucial goods where they need to go, and make mobility more efficient and accessible for all.&amp;nbsp; Aurora is seeking a Senior Fleet Planner to join the Operations Excellence team in Dallas, TX. In this role, you will lead the planning and analysis of our logistics network, resource allocation, and load scheduling strategies to optimize efficiency and profitability. You will partner cross-functionally to&amp;nbsp; translate operational challenges into scalable, data-informed solutions that support both commercial and development priorities. This role requires strong analytical skills combined with business acumen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Business Development, and Dispatch stakeholders to develop and optimize weekly network and resource plans across people, trucks, and terminals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build forecasting models to optimize fleet allocation, load management, and network efficiency against commercial and development demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business problems into analytical frameworks and actionable recommendations that drive operational decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope and define business requirements for fleet allocation, scheduling, load management, and optimization tools in partnership with Product and Engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage weekly resource allocation schedules based on operational inputs and outputs (fleet allocation, load management, etc.) and network optimization tools&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop performance metrics and dashboards to monitor utilization, identify constraints, and improve operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate executive-ready analyses and recommendations on current and projected resource utilization, operational performance, and alignment to revenue plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify constraints and proactively recommend tradeoffs across cost, service, and capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply logistics engineering principles to design and improve terminal layouts, routing logic, and resource flow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong understanding of logistics partner needs, constraints, and service expectations to improve delivery and cost-effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS in Industrial Engineering, Economics, Mathematics, Statistics, Finance, Supply Chain, Operations Research, or a related quantitative field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in logistics, supply chain, network planning, or operations strategy, with a focus on data analysis and network optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building forecasting, allocation, or optimization models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced modeling skills in Excel or Google Sheets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using&amp;nbsp; logistics, planning, or analytics tools to support operational workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using data to solve operational problems and influence business decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to present insights to technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate effectively in ambiguous, fast-changing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment and ability to drive work from problem definition through execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence cross-functional stakeholders and translate analysis into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high-growth tech or startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Lean Six Sigma principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Looker, Tableau, or similar BI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with engineering or product teams to develop operational tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in transportation, logistics, or autonomous vehicle operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this position is&amp;nbsp; $104,000 - 150,000 per year.&amp;nbsp; Aurora’s pay ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Within the range, the successful candidate’s starting base pay will be determined based on factors including job-related skills, experience, qualifications, relevant education or training, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future. The successful candidate will also be eligible for an annual bonus, equity compensation, and benefits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-KM23&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#Mid-Senior&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Aurora&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Aurora, we bring together extraordinarily talented and experienced people united by the strength of our values. We operate with integrity, set outrageous goals, and build a culture where we win together — all without any jerks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in-person work increases collaboration, empathy and our ability to lead effectively. As a result, we operate in a hybrid work environment where Aurorans are in office at least 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our&lt;a href=&quot;https://aurora.tech/careers&quot;&gt; Careers page&lt;/a&gt; provides insight into what it is like to work at Aurora, and you can find all the latest updates in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://aurora.tech/newsroom&quot;&gt;Newsroom&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our commitment to safety&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the core of everything we do is our commitment to safety. Building best-in-class self-driving technology will take time, and we believe that each employee at Aurora has a role in contributing to safety, every step of the way. Aurora expects commitment to our safety policies from every employee, and seeks candidates who take an active responsibility, can contribute to building an atmosphere of trust, and invest in the organization’s long-term success by prioritizing working safely, no matter what.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our commitment to inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aurora considers candidates without regard to their race, color, religion, national origin, age, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, marital status, pregnancy status, parent or caregiver status, ancestry, political affiliation, veteran and/or military status, physical or mental disability, or any other status protected by federal or state law. Aurora considers qualified applicants with criminal histories, consistent with applicable federal, state, and local law. We are also committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If you need assistance or an accommodation due to a disability, you may contact us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:careersiteaccommodations@aurora.tech&quot;&gt;careersiteaccommodations@aurora.tech&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For California applicants, information collected and processed as part of your application and any job applications you choose to submit is subject to Aurora’s California Employment Privacy Policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

sggc-alphasense:greenhouse:8511573002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The world’s most sophisticated companies rely on AlphaSense to remove uncertainty from decision-making. With market intelligence and search built on proven AI, AlphaSense delivers insights that matter from content you can trust. Our universe of public and private content includes equity research, company filings, event transcripts, expert calls, news, trade journals, and clients’ own research content. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The acquisition of Tegus by AlphaSense in 2024 advances our shared mission to empower professionals to make smarter decisions through AI-driven market intelligence. Together, AlphaSense and Tegus will accelerate growth, innovation, and content expansion, with complementary product and content capabilities that enable users to unearth even more comprehensive insights from thousands of content sets. Our platform is trusted by over 6,000 enterprise customers, including a majority of the S&amp;amp;P 500. Founded in 2011, AlphaSense is headquartered in New York City with more than 2,000 employees across the globe and offices in the U.S., U.K., Finland, India, Singapore, Canada, and Ireland. Come join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense’s Design team is a strategic driver of product differentiation, shaping how the world’s leading companies make high-stakes decisions with confidence. We believe great UX is not just about usability, it’s about deeply understanding our customers’ workflows and building experiences that feel tailored, intelligent, and indispensable to how they work.&lt;br&gt;As AlphaSense evolves into an AI-native platform, Design plays a critical role in defining how AI shows up in real workflows, from search to synthesis to decision-making. We partner closely with Product and Engineering to turn complex data and advanced AI capabilities into cohesive, intuitive, and high-quality experiences.&lt;br&gt;Our team is a global group of craftspeople, systems thinkers, and innovators who care deeply about quality, velocity, and impact. We operate with a strong sense of ownership, a bias toward action, and a commitment to raising the bar for what great product design looks like in an AI-first world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are seeking a Principal Design Engineer to play a key role in shaping the future of AlphaSense’s product experience. This is a senior individual contributor role, where you’ll lead through craft, systems thinking, and technical excellence, building AI-powered experiences that feel tailored, intelligent, and essential to our customers’ workflows.&lt;br&gt;You will operate at the intersection of design, engineering, and product strategy, translating complex, data-rich problems into high-quality, production-ready experiences. You won’t just prototype ideas; you’ll define how they are built, scaled, and experienced in the product.&lt;br&gt;As a senior member of the Design team, you’ll act as a multiplier—mentoring others, guiding technical and design decisions, and strengthening the connection between user needs, business goals, and engineering realities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At AlphaSense, design is a core driver of how we win. As we build an AI-native platform, the quality of our user experience will define how effectively customers can navigate complexity, build conviction, and make decisions.&lt;br&gt;In this role, you will help define that standard—through the systems you build, the experiences you ship, and the team you help elevate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create high-fidelity, coded prototypes and interaction models that bring complex, AI-powered workflows to life and clearly communicate product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own high-impact initiatives from concept through production, shipping experiences that reflect strong design thinking, technical rigor, and a deep understanding of customer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical design discussions, make architectural decisions, and guide cross-team implementation efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance AlphaSense’s design system as a core piece of product infrastructure—defining scalable patterns, enabling consistency, and accelerating teams building across AI-native experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product managers, engineers, and other stakeholders to research and evaluate user requirements, translate them into effective designs, and ensure that the final product meets both user and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams during development, advocating for design quality and user experience by championing design fidelity and attention to detail throughout the development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Leadership &amp;amp; Team Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior leader within the Design team, mentoring designers and engineers, raising the bar for craft, and contributing to a strong, collaborative design culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as connective tissue across design, product, and engineering—helping teams navigate tradeoffs between technical constraints, business goals, and user experience to deliver high-quality outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in product design, design/UX/front-end engineering, design systems, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree or higher. A degree in design, computer science, information sciences, psychology, or human-computer interaction is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with modern front-end technologies (e.g., HTML/CSS, JavaScript/TypeScript, React) and evolving design systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI and agentic experiences, and you are already leveraging AI to speed up and augment your end-to-end design and development process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with modern AI technologies and ability to apply them to design problems (e.g., MCP, Claude Code, Codex, Skills).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping production-ready experiences and influencing technical and design choices across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of user-centered design principles, end-to-end customer workflows, and the ability to turn new users into habitual users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in project leadership, mentorship, and providing constructive feedback to foster professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

sggc-alphasense:greenhouse:8527512002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The world’s most sophisticated companies rely on AlphaSense to remove uncertainty from decision-making. With market intelligence and search built on proven AI, AlphaSense delivers insights that matter from content you can trust. Our universe of public and private content includes equity research, company filings, event transcripts, expert calls, news, trade journals, and clients’ own research content. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The acquisition of Tegus by AlphaSense in 2024 advances our shared mission to empower professionals to make smarter decisions through AI-driven market intelligence. Together, AlphaSense and Tegus will accelerate growth, innovation, and content expansion, with complementary product and content capabilities that enable users to unearth even more comprehensive insights from thousands of content sets. Our platform is trusted by over 6,000 enterprise customers, including a majority of the S&amp;amp;P 500. Founded in 2011, AlphaSense is headquartered in New York City with more than 2,000 employees across the globe and offices in the U.S., U.K., Finland, India, Singapore, Canada, and Ireland. Come join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Web Infra is part of our Engineering Platforms org. We own the foundation frontend engineers build on: CI/CD, build tooling, observability, feature flags, microfrontend architecture, performance optimisation, and engineering standards across a ~2.8M LOC React monorepo. Every frontend engineer at AlphaSense ships through the platform we build. The decisions we make directly influence engineering velocity, deployment confidence, reliability, and developer experience across the company. We obsess over developer productivity, measuring success through build times, deployment reliability, DORA metrics, and developer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The current team is based in Europe, and we’re hiring our first engineer in the US. As the first US-based member of Web Infra, you’ll play a key role in strengthening how the team supports product engineering across the region while contributing to the evolution of our frontend platform. This is intentionally a Principal-level role: you’ll be expected to identify opportunities, set direction, and drive high-impact initiatives with a high degree of autonomy rather than operate from a prescriptive backlog. You’ll work closely with the European team on strategy and roadmap while owning outcomes end-to-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A key part of this role is embedding AI into the SDLC in a way that meaningfully augments engineers&#39; day-to-day workflows. We believe the next generation of engineering productivity will be driven by AI-native development experiences, and you&#39;ll help define how frontend engineers at AlphaSense build, test, debug, and ship software at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Principal-level experience in platform engineering, developer experience, or internal tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on background with Web CI/CD: pipeline design, reliability, build optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with CDN and edge infrastructure (CloudFront, Lambda@Edge, S3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of modern frontend — React at scale, microfrontends, module federation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling frontend observability: errors, performance, RUM and analytics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of improving DevEx metrics in the right direction (DORA, DX insights, CSAT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong instinct for finding systemic friction and solving it pragmatically&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to operate independently in a distributed team across a timezone gap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience applying AI tooling to real engineering workflows&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in EST timezone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with progressive delivery and feature flag platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with test platforms and QA automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Kubernetes-based infrastructure and cloud-native deployment patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work on a platform or DX team serving frontend engineers specifically&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and improve the dev loop for frontend: local dev, build, test — fast, reliable, no flakiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive CI/CD reliability, speed, and deployment confidence across the frontend platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve microfrontend architecture, module patterns, and the standards inside the monorepo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain self-service tooling and internal platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed AI across the web SDLC — code authoring, testing, debugging, documentation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, track and improve developer productivity metrics: build time, DORA, developer CSAT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify systemic friction in the developer journey and fix it with solutions that scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For base compensation, we set standard ranges for all roles based on function and level benchmarked against similar stage growth companies and internal comparables. In order to be compliant with local legislation, as well as to provide greater transparency to candidates, we share salary ranges on all job postings regardless of desired hiring location. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors including candidate experience/expertise and may vary from the amounts listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may also be offered equity, and a generous benefits program.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$246,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$339,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

sggc-avepoint:greenhouse:7649255.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Lead/Senior UX Designer to guide UX design practices across the Ministry of Social and Family Development (MSF) cluster. This is a strategic role that requires both hands-on design expertise and the ability to lead cross-ministry initiatives, working with senior stakeholders across multiple projects and teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Expertise&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of progressive UX/UI design experience, with at least 3 years in a senior or lead capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading design initiatives across multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience working with senior stakeholders and C-level executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in government, enterprise, or large-scale organizational settings is highly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio demonstrating product thinking, strategic leadership, design process, and measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with design research methodologies and usability testing tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency in design tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of responsive design, design systems, and component libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with front-end technologies (HTML, CSS) and ability to collaborate effectively with developers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional presentation and communication skills with ability to influence at all organizational levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience facilitating design workshops, critique sessions, and collaborative design activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills with demonstrated ability to build consensus and drive alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to mentor and develop design talent while establishing a culture of design excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinking with ability to translate business objectives into user-centered design solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Work Environment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across multiple concurrent projects with ITG teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with vendors and external partners on various ministry systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface regularly with stakeholders from different ministry divisions including policy, operations, and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projects span citizen-facing applications, case management systems, content management platforms, and data analytics tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Ideal Candidate&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond the listed qualifications, we are looking for someone who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balances strategic vision with hands-on execution and isn&#39;t afraid to roll up their sleeves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to harmonise between product thinking and design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is comfortable operating with ambiguity and establishing practices in a maturing design function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brings curiosity about social services, policy, and public sector challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates empathy for both end users (citizens, social workers) and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a collaborative mindset and thrives in cross-functional team environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Values impact over perfection and can navigate the pragmatic realities of government technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Application Process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interested candidates should submit:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resume/CV highlighting relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio demonstrating UX process, stakeholder engagement, and design outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief statement (300-500 words) describing your approach to establishing UX practices in a complex organizational environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Any personal data you share with us during the application process will be processed strictly in compliance with applicable data protection laws and our &lt;a id=&quot;menur12n&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.avepoint.com/company/privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

techaviv-betterhelp:greenhouse:414669600.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;UpLift – Redefining Access to Mental Healthcare&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At UpLift, we believe mental health is just as important as physical health — and we&#39;re rethinking the mental healthcare model. UpLift is a multi-sided marketplace, applying technology to empower patients to find Therapists and Psychiatric providers covered by their insurance plan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While 1 in 5 Americans struggle with mental health issues, only 40% of this group received care in the last year. At the same time, only 30% of therapists accept insurance. UpLift acts as the bridge between patient, provider, and insurer — empowering patients to find the best care for their needs at a price they can afford.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join UpLift&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimated Effective Hourly Earnings*:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Earnings between $100 to $140 per hour is based on a 60-minute session assumption that includes a combination of patient visits and hourly equivalent CPT codes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expand access to care:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide psychiatric services to individuals who otherwise may not have access to mental healthcare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative model:&lt;/strong&gt; Work hand-in-hand with UpLift’s network of licensed therapists to deliver world-class, evidence-based care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All-in-one virtual platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Focus on your patients — UpLift handles credentialing, enrollment, and platform operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work from anywhere:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is 100% remote, with care delivered via UpLift’s purpose-built telemedicine platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible commitment:&lt;/strong&gt; Part-time, 1099 contract position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct video consultations and message with patients via telemedicine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess, screen, diagnose, and prescribe medication as clinically appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate treatment planning and care delivery with UpLift’s network of therapists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide empathetic, high-quality care and uphold UpLift’s clinical and service standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share product and workflow feedback with UpLift’s engineering and operations teams to help improve care delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At least one year of experience&lt;/strong&gt; as a certified Psychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioner (PMHNP) or licensed Psychiatrist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active medical license in Delaware, in good standing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable prescribing medication when clinically appropriate and permitted by state law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at using online tools and technology to deliver virtual care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous telemedicine experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multiple state licenses and fluency in additional languages are strong advantages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important to Know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a part-time, contract (1099) position — not a salaried employee role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UpLift will credential and enroll you with multiple health plans to expand access to insured patients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All care is delivered remotely through UpLift’s telehealth platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All clinical decisions are made independently by licensed providers in accordance with state telehealth laws and professional standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;License/Certification:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical License (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMHNP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delaware (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work Location: Remote&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Estimated effective hourly earnings are for &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;licensed Psychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioners in Delaware&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; and are&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; illustrative estimates&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; derived from modeled assumptions, not a guaranteed hourly rate, wage, or salary. These estimates are calculated using assumptions regarding number of completed visits per hour, CPT code mix, and utilization of add-on codes (such as 90833) &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;when clinically appropriate and properly documented&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Actual earnings vary and are dependent on individual clinical decisions, case mix, scheduling availability, payer reimbursement, licensure, and geographic market factors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

